{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:382f77f4d2dc3b750420f3c6fe0cb6c7066418e521b57c71d0c5ee71efce95ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e8b50f7efc1a8808aaeb93cbded3277e8a6ca14391bba6c8796c6e537f25f65",
      "text": "甜点展销会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48526d38026788d0fa845b50d66ff4eab16fb3c2a619d543c3cfa6ea8864d6e5",
      "text": "这就是活动限定甜点……\n这种水果的搭配真是引人注目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be1328ff09ab80b5f90cfd68edca8b4bff3348c30e95de1184b654838723288",
      "text": "哎呀，欢迎光临。\n那个可是我的自信之作哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7730c360e819fd5e3a9ae8463aeb1223a104c8855d622169bfacedd1a237c4b",
      "text": "您是……那个，关于这次的限定商品，\n可以向您详细请教一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eec244ad48d2ab25b4fefff9204a650c132cfe005c895184852e853e8ea77e8",
      "text": "（这位，就是庄一郎先生尊敬的\n糕点师吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720a45c09f72ba7032be24cc1f4634693968481d91146adead1e698d4e907002",
      "text": "是的呢。我也觉得，味道自不必说，\n还希望能让人在外表上也享受到甜点的美妙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e1965a4373413b4931e4bd8c41f1436c8374e16600e29f81fe1444f711e085",
      "text": "（庄一郎先生看起来好开心。\n他是真的很喜欢西式糕点啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329b45cb19cd7f6739deff00854fb54bd88a0e9d3535b36296a3b735f599097a",
      "text": "十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e0433330e98d1cdbe7864575e3a3aecc1093eb71c387abcb2f8484487edafd",
      "text": "抱歉，●●●●プロデューサー。\n聊得太投入花了太长时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b639d17c41cfb34e99ea6db7f5d44d741b2df824f4edf534e2532171ce1c9bd",
      "text": "没关系的！\n那位就是您提到的那位糕点师吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cbf31fe0c01c9c63427343d3692cb76cbf9761fef127bae9d566309b1769202",
      "text": "是的。真没想到能得到他本人的亲自讲解……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419e0dad8b337b893563ab20514a8442f56bbde1ba97b5125526ad28db0642cd",
      "text": "不，现在可不是高兴的时候。其他的限定商品，\n也必须在卖完前去买回来才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad659d9b01c822014ba072b27063c3953c2ab4a68a8947358172a2d89a1e5868",
      "text": "也请制作人搭把手协助一下。\n之后我们一起去用餐区品尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
